: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           庄园/处理厂：索非娅庄园 Finca Sofia\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          系列：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          传奇系列\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Heritage Collection\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           地块：高地鸽子\n          </span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Torcaza\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            批次：FS13425\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           海拔：2026 米 masl\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"le